# Absorb three-stage no-loss POC checklist

- [ ] Compare all V5/V7/V8/V10 baseline dimensions against the three-stage outputs.
- [ ] Treat missing files, malformed shapes and lost Trace categories as failures or explicit unknowns.
- [ ] Keep historical POC success separate from current live runtime verification.
- [ ] Write only bounded report/comparison artifacts and never mutate baselines.
- [ ] Do not call models, DBs, tmux, Devin, Solver or the network.
